        "data": {
          "comment": "# Comfy Patina- Material Extract\n\nPull a seamless, tiling PBR material out of a photo of a surface with Patina. The prompt says which surface to extract and which structure to keep, and the base texture comes back with basecolor, normal, roughness, metalness and height maps aligned pixel for pixel. Made for photos that already contain the material you want: brick walls, paving, plaster, fabric. Runs on Comfy Cloud and needs Comfy Cloud partner credits.\n\n**How it works:** The Comfy nodes form the complete template graph. Run submits the graph to Comfy Cloud and saves its outputs.\n\n**Try this:** Change the prompt or the Load node inputs and run again to compare results.\n\nSource: https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/blob/1ae390968e323dba24a6991d1860ded051f5a79b/templates/api_patina_material_extract.json (MIT). Model licenses apply separately."
